{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_04d08ece3e59789e2123736bd0be72b93e3aa34ff53d91a6b01a689cfe1e4ad7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4da845aa0cf52e4b9349d1fd3dfa568c5d9832d7aa68f32f5e126912f50f149b","slc_6acb0531504e7cb4587b2224e657bda9c6b18b1db4d55a464af07023bfb4ab24","slc_fff1c02bdbc1693d8d41e7d4f1a673a70fb1bf6ba363937e9699314a14cf8ad7"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"scode speaks the Agent Communication Protocol natively over two transports sharing one handler chain: `scode acp` over stdio and `scode acp serve --port N` over WebSocket.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_08645cf940261c73a8ca3456e070460e7304f72a72951d88369390f182ee166f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_287f59ed8d7c1a2200fd8a6276a7631b7aac1b447e230fed70c48bd7fb8316a8","slc_fc85dfbea88ec50245773114d1c2517c60f2e1b00f438278b79a82e6ae86ca03"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"Sessions persist as JSONL under `<cwd>/.scode/sessions/<workspace-fingerprint>/`; session/load restores transcript, model, compaction state and fork lineage, but not permission-mode overrides, background commands, or MCP servers not passed in the request.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b6ad02d2676386c1605fc8e4caefab386d742f10aa740c46abf7fe901633200","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_348ea9b88caf15622a7544fba624428aa3c2373a83e66ef71a2f3ec3562b3f97","slc_69c2a8f29b446ee70d4e2b5bf5b5754486b380f028afec6526f537e10f789282"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"Automatic compaction trims oversized tool text (over 8,192 code points) to a head/tail with marker before running a checkpoint pipeline; successful replacement archives the original transcript as `<transcript>.before-compact-<timestamp>`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ccf0cc1810d8b21b293ba31acfef57dc1cd325ffc4097959cfd7e39aed03dca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_46f49378d0299d489bdc24c83c9f478acaa91e8620fca4d240dcb439e50cfe51","slc_b17e00692278c5601d4f5a10dcdab16e4ce052c9118c5461a4f8a618bad22826"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"The WebSocket server exposes JSON-RPC at ws://localhost:8080/ws plus an embedded interactive Web UI at http://localhost:8080/; both transports share streaming, tool use, elicitation and permission prompting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_417cdff9cb1fb7401495ead4fb2d106bb82922ce1beaf903f85af3be8fbe5b6d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_09ad19031a6e176fc8256d9ee2394591d87a327c6d3324b02997bcdb760966ac","slc_585f80d03c78d2cd3557670c1aa4f91b32aa7cbfb5a0af6f629f5a7d836fa7dc","slc_a1953025280766cd3f52e221841a60d499a450a212b36120dd7618e2a84b20fa"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"A session/prompt starting with `/` runs as a slash command (e.g. /help, /status, /cost, /model, /compact, /diff, /doctor), and the agent advertises the command table via a session/update notification after session/new or session/load.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_691a52f2580adc08639655701c876431c5dfc948220c486c9175eb04fba15791","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_033c4f9aa75be75ffbdfac4542cf66d423c3efc4d2898e24091d3fc3dfb6b6f4","slc_266dc27d6190a524f72dd8da700f73977137ac1164d4b8651802f37a38e4f40b","slc_cdf68dae14346eedbd90d4a44ec5e3c718ca7e206cf68ec44f1443d30d527c1e"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"Per-session memory is controlled via `_meta.sudocode.memory`; 'disabled' means the session neither reads nor writes the persistent memory directory, and disabling never deletes existing entries.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6c84ee8add798f08a7ed95ba56f65344fd49176ca2362cb12c366dbcadea80c4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_52cfe3f22f5f70f7d3335ae492e9be6c25df2293679b573dec7c54d019178d20","slc_8afe2da1da8ee7a4bf1a5e770e10936c989822a93d2eccf0ace923ea47307af6"],"source_ids":["src_f26e4333dde05645a1d409ce68f0408b"],"text":"Sudo Code positions itself as an agent unit, not an orchestrator: it plugs into a nexus-VFS `chat-with-me` mailbox primitive so humans, orchestrators, or peer agents over ACP can drive it.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_80a98ef88606fed64048f87c211ad90e4cd57298bde92d2733167287334378b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ef4b366dc6045db242ced62b130dc8c37c05eb1be96c3ffb324e7573c1efa003","slc_f98d725f484a4eb0075b7360047828ad7a6510f1995b0ca175e58ec03740f420","slc_fa2c12cca658fdd449d5bd5882b17ed95a6a2873be1647e190f9478ce43072b5"],"source_ids":["src_5d4e89750e125dbeaa6e4b50435091ec"],"text":"Authentication supports three modes — subscription (CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN), proxy (PROXY_AUTH_TOKEN + PROXY_BASE_URL), and api-key (Anthropic, OpenAI, xAI, Gemini, DashScope keys) — with auto-detection in that order.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b502023c83300e2516d2a13d7084bab111158fc3a64c1a2a1e6ac27308de8618","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1084dcee38a3b482411b0a70bf2954a2b65e740853c0660b6b5e626e0325f44a","slc_4d0ba25e405743969524faec8dec907d9086cbcb5c88d69f5954ff5d921360d1"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"Forking via `session/new` with `_meta.sudocode.forkFrom` copies the source transcript into a new first-class session under the new cwd; the source is read, never modified, and the initialize response advertises sessionFork for feature detection.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c12ebc788c4fab2c9191876d5b65f2fdd3723ad1837703a063e03cbc4c81d403","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8133a77e8e7d22d86f8d551ac8da1bbefcd5a34c4efa1edbbf75f221832ca497","slc_e75b468f024fbd7dcb5351df03bb8ffd7e688a13911d8c456d43b826f6633b7e"],"source_ids":["src_b91a8fc98a015822b63b5babccdb5ccc"],"text":"ACP sessions accept `_meta.sudocode.systemPrompt` (replaces built-in static system-prompt blocks) and `appendSystemPrompt` (appended after them); non-string or empty values are rejected with invalid_params (-32602).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c70c1ca32d78f554c24a1a2ad80cb4101849d6686668fe0a8ad47c9895a27d56","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_445e2e5f41b48b48dcd122fb4c20760768e7290919aff38bd7025b0cd67a889e","slc_4de484dd58d99bcef36a1d221d9939411921768d09e8d1166e092401c4a3232a","slc_e0f35ae0aad9d483930cf162ae0e2ff507f53ac5f68e740f7ea23a82b2277837"],"source_ids":["src_f26e4333dde05645a1d409ce68f0408b"],"text":"One scode binary serves copilot, worker, or standalone roles depending on the FsBackend implementation: StdFsBackend (host std::fs), NexusVfsFsBackend (gRPC to remote kernel), or KernelFsBackend (in-process syscalls).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f7c23209a3ab0f22735ca3e247b046d219f653cb2cd8c0dadf75f4ba8787cd7d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sudoprivacy/sudocode@a67bb90f5c4b snapshot 8fb393471e10b339","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_461ca7afa2d8e69a907307165106408ba854c182acc41df27f674a78708b95cc","slc_77d1c45fb8b0e0879c6abc3fcafb0870e5a57adb0ac80e7ff10f70be49cea206"],"source_ids":["src_f26e4333dde05645a1d409ce68f0408b"],"text":"The project commits to inline-only terminal output (no alternate-screen TUI, no ratatui), local-first operation with zero telemetry by default, and semver stability with no forced auto-updates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:40:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df20977a884a494a8a61150159f9f604"}
